comments[6]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-03T18:06:41.043Z","harness:codex","GitHub source: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/1186. All-status duplicate check searched missing receipt history reference, strict health, reconcile, and remediation. pm-wn3ee5 closed preferred-era shape compatibility and pm-lwmstb closed ordinary pending-receipt settlement, but this fleet report proves the distinct unrecoverable clone-local-reference path still has no remedy. A new recurrence item preserves both shipped baselines."
  "2026-09-03T18:07:09.387Z","harness:codex","GitHub linkage comment: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/1186#issuecomment-5530007892"
  "2026-09-04T05:49:53.199Z","harness:codex","Implementation evidence: history health now classifies missing receipt coordinates precisely and accepts only audited dispositions for pre-durable receipt references, with exact item/receipt/original-line identity and a strictly later disposition event. pm merge reconcile --force appends grouped merge_reconcile history repair events, re-runs health, and refuses malformed, missing, or post-cutoff coordinates. Focused unit/integration/remediation suites recorded 42 passing tests."
  "2026-09-04T05:49:54.131Z","harness:codex","Manual acceptance evidence: a real temporary Git repository produced an item-file merge conflict through the installed merge driver; the newer document priority 4 was retained over priority 1, receipt policy reported latest_document_update/document_updated_at, a fresh clone exposed bounded_inline review values, dry-run reconciliation reported the legacy reference, and forced reviewed reconciliation returned ok:true with strict health restored."
  "2026-09-04T06:23:33.457Z","harness:codex","Final repository verification: pnpm quality:static passed the complete mandatory static gate; node scripts/run-tests.mjs coverage passed 603 files and 8,350 tests at exact 100% statements, branches, functions, and lines; pnpm security:scan, pnpm audit, documentation links, and package-artifact checks passed. GitHub Dependabot, code-scanning, and secret-scanning alert inventories were empty. Focused reconciliation, health-classification, remediation, and legacy-history integration tests passed; the real temporary Git workflow also proved fail-closed conflict handling and successful audited reconciliation."
  "2026-09-04T06:42:49.530Z","harness:codex","Terminal closeout evidence: exact-tree coverage passed 603 files and 8,351 tests at 100/100/100/100; reconciliation now validates receipt evidence before any disposition mutation, and the complete static-quality pipeline passed."
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-04T06:22:42.830Z","harness:codex","A legacy missing-receipt disposition is trustworthy only when it names the exact item, receipt id, and original history line and is appended after that reference; item-level forgiveness permits forged or stale suppression."
